<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SED Int'l started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SED Int'l started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said it initiated coverage of SED International Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $20.</p>
<p>-- the shares ended Friday at 14.</p>
<p>-- the company recently changed its name from Southern Electronics Distributors Inc.</p>
</text>
